<title>ESTONIA: BULLISH MARKET TAKES ALL STOCKS HIGHER.</title>
<headline>BULLISH MARKET TAKES ALL STOCKS HIGHER.</headline>
<text>
<p>*Total trade on Estonian bourse was 56.6 million kroons of shares</p>
<p>*The Talse gained 2.17 percent to close on 225.24</p>
<p>*Hansapank and Forekspank most active with good gains</p>
